<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Appraise</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Assassin (guild level 0), Conjurer (guild level 0, up to 90%), Druid (guild level 0, up to 60%), Healer (guild level 0, up to 70%), Necromancer (guild level 0, up to 60%), Ranger (guild level 0, up to 80%), Sorcerer (guild level 0), Thief (guild level 0)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>appraise &lt;item&gt;
</pre>
<p>Used to figure out how much an item is worth, whether you carry it or it lies in the room. Beware that you might make a wrong guess depending on how skilled you are: the better your brain and your appraisal skill, the more often you get it right.
</p>




</div>